{
  "$comment": [
    "A deliberately small stand-in for upstream's product.json, used to verify",
    "apps/ide/branding/product.delta.jq without cloning microsoft/vscode.",
    "",
    "It is not a copy of upstream's file and is not trying to be. It contains one",
    "representative of each shape the delta has to handle correctly:",
    "",
    "  * keys the delta overrides (nameShort, applicationName, win32x64AppId)",
    "  * keys the delta deletes (aiConfig, msftInternalDomains, defaultChatAgent)",
    "  * keys the delta must leave alone (extensionAllowedProposedApi, commit,",
    "    date, checksums) - the assertion that upstream's own additions survive",
    "  * all seven recommendation maps, in both the array and object shapes,",
    "    populated with Marketplace publisher ids",
    "  * a gallery pointed at marketplace.visualstudio.com, so the generated",
    "    output can be fed to the audit gate and observed to pass only because",
    "    the delta repointed it",
    "",
    "The values are invented. The point of the fixture is the shape."
  ],
